          </div>
          <div class="gm-step">
            <div class="gm-step-num">02</div>
            <h3>Wait 30--60 minutes</h3>
            <p>The gummy is absorbed through digestion. A full stomach can slow this further. Do not redose before 60 minutes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="gm-step">
            <div class="gm-step-num">03</div>
            <h3>Effects begin</h3>
            <p>Onset is gradual and builds over time. Microdose effects are typically mild -- a subtle lift in mood or relaxation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="gm-step">
            <div class="gm-step-num">04</div>
            <h3>Effects last 2--4 hours</h3>
            <p>Unlike smoking, edible effects are sustained. Find a comfortable setting and enjoy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gm-dosing-note">
          Do not drive or operate machinery. Do not combine with alcohol. Not suitable for pregnant or breastfeeding women, or anyone under 20. If you take regular medication, consult a healthcare professional before consuming cannabis edibles.
