        </div>
        <div class="gm-buying-card">
          <div class="gm-buying-icon">🔬</div>
          <h3>Full-spectrum vs. distillate</h3>
          <p>Distillate isolates THC and strips out other plant compounds. Full-spectrum products preserve the natural cannabinoid and terpene profile, which many researchers believe produces a more rounded effect.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gm-buying-card">
          <div class="gm-buying-icon">📦</div>
          <h3>Proper packaging</h3>
          <p>Look for individually sealed, tamper-evident packaging. Nitrogen-flushed packs extend shelf life and maintain freshness. Loose, unpackaged product is a red flag.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gm-buying-card">
          <div class="gm-buying-icon">📋</div>
          <h3>Clear dosing information</h3>
          <p>The label should state THC per piece, net weight, and storage instructions. If that information isn't visible on the packaging, don't buy it.</p>
        </div>
